// fetcher: another robot has the charger: borrow it.
// method: behave
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !ask_for_charger r2
//   2. &recharge l4
//   3. &travel_to l4
//   4. &fetch o1

distance l1 l1 0
distance l1 l2 1
distance l1 l3 2
distance l1 l4 3
distance l2 l1 1
distance l2 l2 0
distance l2 l3 1
distance l2 l4 2
distance l3 l1 2
distance l3 l2 1
distance l3 l3 0
distance l3 l4 1
distance l4 l1 3
distance l4 l2 2
distance l4 l3 1
distance l4 l4 0
job fetch o1
at l1
battery 1
charger_with r2
robot_at r2 l2
object_at o1 l4
